OL,3,GNEWSALawyer jailed for supplying
OL,4,Acocaine after getting 'too close' to
OL,5,Adrug dealing client
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe criminal defence solicitor of a
OL,8,Fdrug dealer has been jailed for three
OL,9,Fyears and six months after he became
OL,10,Finvolved in supplying cocaine.
OL,12,FBen Garvey, 38, encouraged his friends
OL,13,Fto purchase the class A drug over
OL,14,FWhatsApp, and also passed messages
OL,15,Fbetween his client and a drug runner.
OL,17,FGarvey, from Port Talbot, was told by a
OL,18,Fjudge at Bristol Crown Court that his
OL,19,Factions had been "a clear abuse" of his
OL,20,Fposition, after he was found guilty of
OL,21,Fsupplying cocaine and perverting the
OL,22,Fcourse of justice.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
