OL,3,GNEWSALawyer jailed for supplying
OL,4,Acocaine after getting 'too close' to
OL,5,Adrug dealing client
OL,6,
OL,7,FHis ex-client, Daniel Baker, 34, was
OL,8,Fjailed for three years and four months
OL,9,Fafter pleading guilty to perverting the
OL,10,Fcourse of justice and admitting
OL,11,Fconspiracy to supply Class A drugs.
